{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:31bdbf92eaf12e85","name":"Naxy Screeger","source":{"id":"source:reference-31bdbf92eaf12e85","title":"Naxy Screeger","revision":20260,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:31:07Z","sha256":"b962ae9f7cc9741bc22e2741f560f0d13c3e7520b08eabeb735377972493337b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20260","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Naxy%20Screeger&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-31bdbf92eaf12e85","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Naxy Screeger is an irritating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sakiyan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sakiyan","referenceId":"reference:9e6af1738654c891"}," gambler, short on cash but long on excuses. The talkative fringer always has something to say, whether it is an excuse, minor threat, or bungled insult. Just about anyone who knows Naxy also knows someone he owes money to. His grasp of Basic is tenuous, but he doesn't let that stop him. Naxy eventually irritates the pirate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rav"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rav","referenceId":"reference:c5abb80ae0de96f3"}," by skipping out on a bail bond, thereby earning a bounty large enough to attract the attention of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cade Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cade_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:721cf41d59303a07"}," and the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Mynock"]}," crew. They catch the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sakiyan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sakiyan","referenceId":"reference:9e6af1738654c891"}," at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar's Cantina"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar%27s_Cantina?action=edit&redlink=1"},", along with the Jedi ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hosk Trey'lis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hosk_Trey%27lis","referenceId":"reference:74eb188cd3ef7dc3"},", and turn Naxy over to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rav"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rav","referenceId":"reference:c5abb80ae0de96f3"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The cunning, or lucky, Screeger survives Rav's wrath. However, it's debatable how much longer he can get by on wits alone, particularly after he helps ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cade Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cade_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:721cf41d59303a07"}," and the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Mynock"]}," crew finagle Chak's ship, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Grinning Liar"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Grinning_Liar","referenceId":"reference:09e6bc669db675fe"},", out of the pirate lord's clutches.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Naxy Screeger Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sakiyan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sakiyan","referenceId":"reference:9e6af1738654c891"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +1; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p"